{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12425","headline":"避暑纳凉 · 钱起","name":"避暑纳凉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木槿花开畏日长，时摇轻扇倚绳牀。\n初晴草蔓缘新笋，频雨苔衣染旧墙。\n十旬河朔应虚醉，八柱天台好纳凉。\n无事始然知静胜，深垂纱帐咏沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}